    <briefdescription>
<para>Determine the iterated dominance frontier, given a set of defining blocks, and optionally, a set of live-in blocks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In turn, the results can be used to place phi nodes.</para>
<para>This algorithm is a linear time computation of Iterated Dominance Frontiers, pruned using the live-in set. By default, liveness is not used to prune the IDF computation. The template parameters should be of a CFG block type. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
